  "notes": "The Law on General Education (art. 8) sets 12-year schooling: elementary school grades 1–4, middle school 5–9 (together the basic school, հիմնական դպրոց, grades 1–9) and high school 10–12. Some schools (վարժարան) cover grades 5–12."
